T: Registration Workflow) --> Input[/INPUT: Licenses Held, Approved for Registration, Role, Office Locations, Client Locations/]
    Input --> Approved{Approved for Registration == True?}
    
    Approved -->|FALSE| Hold[Hold: Do Not Submit Form U4] --> EndNode(END)
    Approved -->|TRUE| S65{Licenses == Series 65 ONLY or CFP/CFA/ChFC/CIC/PFS Waiver?}
    
    S65 -->|TRUE| RegIAR[Register as IAR or RA ONLY under CFP CRD 175112]
    S65 -->|FALSE| DualCheck{Dual-Registering AND Holds Series 66 AND Series 7?}
    
    DualCheck -->|TRUE| RegDual[Dual-Register RA + AG/GS under CFP CRD 175112 AND CFS CRD 126291]
    DualCheck -->|FALSE| MissingQual{Missing qualifications, open exam window} --> EndNode

    RegIAR --> IAR_Single
    RegDual --> IAR_Single
    RegDual --> BD_Trade

    subgraph SEC-Registered IAR State Registration - CFP CRD 175112
        IAR_Single{Solicits clients in ONLY home state?}
        IAR_Single -->|TRUE| IAR_Home[File Form U4 - RA in Home State ONLY under CFP CRD 175112]
        IAR_Single -->|FALSE| IAR_Office{Has Physical Place of Business in Target State?}
        IAR_Office -->|TRUE| IAR_Target[File Form U4 - RA in Target State under CFP CRD 175112]
        IAR_Office -->|FALSE| IAR_Exempt[Federal Covered Exemption: No State IAR Filing Required]
    end

    subgraph BD Agent State Registration - CFS CRD 126291
        BD_Trade{Will Solicit, Sell, or Transact Securities for ANY Client in Target State?}
        BD_Trade -->|TRUE| BD_Reg[File Form U4 - AG in Target State under CFS CRD 126291 + Pay Fee]
        BD_Trade -->|FALSE| BD_No[No BD Agent State Registration Required in Target State]
    end

    IAR_Home --> EndNode
    IAR_Target --> EndNode
    IAR_Exempt --> EndNode
    BD_Reg --> EndNode
    BD_No --> EndNode
